<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - West Marine cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - West Marine cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Aram Rubinson downgraded West Marine Inc to attractive from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today, West Marine reported same-store sales for the month of June rose 3.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 6-1/2 to 18-1/4.</p>
</text>
